// A numeric intrinsic called from a named function taken as a value and from a lambda, in a
// module that uses function values. The refusal "is mistaken for a captured variable here — it
// is not yet callable from a lambda" names this shape; the plainest program it forbids runs.
// Should print 3 then 10.
function g(h: (f64) => f64) { return h(9.0) }
function root(x: f64) { return sqrt(x) }
print(g(root))
print(g((y) => abs(y) + floor(1.5)))
